<title>PHILIPPINES: Boulevard says 1996/97 net 26.5 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Boulevard says 1996/97 net 26.5 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boulevard Properties Holdings Inc said on Tuesday it posted a 14.5 percent rise in its net income to reach 26.5 million pesos in the 1996/97 fiscal year ended May.</p>
<p>The Philippine company did not give any comparative figure nor other details of its financial results.</p>
<p>Boulevard is engaged in aviation, telecommunications, real estate, information technology and tourism and leisure development.</p>
<p>-- manila.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
